IDG    : flag to calculate degradation (1, other ignore).
ndgday : no. of days between events
dgKref : kref, pesticide half-life (days)
FC     : top soil field capacity (m3/m3). This can be taken from 
         FOCUS R1-R4 scenario parameters used by the PRZM model
dgPin  : Pin, pesticide mass entering filter (mg)
dgML   : Surface mixing layer thickness (cm, std.=2cm)
dgT(i) : T, daily air temperatures (C) for period between events
